Description: Libraries needed for Tensor Interface Module
 TIM-VX is a software integration module provided by VeriSilicon 
 to facilitate deployment of Neural-Networks on Verisilicon ML accelerators.
 It serves as the backend binding for runtime frameworks 
 such as Android NN, Tensorflow-Lite, MLIR, TVM and more.
